<h2>What Makes Any Desk Exercise Machine Work Better</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Fit under your desk.</strong> Measure the gap between your thigh and the underside of the desk with your feet on the pedals at their highest point. Use our <a href="/tools/desk-clearance-checker/">desk clearance checker</a>.</li>
<li><strong>Anchor it.</strong> A [[amazon:cubii-mat|non-slip mat]] stops the machine creeping forward; [[amazon:caster-cups|caster cups]] stop your chair rolling back.</li>
<li><strong>Use it in scheduled blocks.</strong> A <a href="/tools/desk-pedal-timer/">desk pedal timer</a> turns good intentions into a routine.</li>
<li><strong>Pedal along with motors.</strong> If you own a motorized model, pedal with it for part of each session to turn comfort time into light exercise.</li>
</ul>

<h2>How Effective Is Each Type, by the Numbers?</h2>
<p>We keep the type comparison qualitative here because calorie burn depends heavily on your weight, pace and resistance. For MET values, calories per hour and a comparison against walking and a full-size elliptical, see <a href="/how-effective-is-an-under-the-desk-elliptical/">how effective an under the desk elliptical is</a>. For goal-by-goal timeframes, see <a href="/does-under-desk-elliptical-work/">under desk elliptical results by goal</a>, and to judge whether your sessions count as real exercise, read <a href="/is-an-under-desk-elliptical-good-exercise/">is an under desk elliptical good exercise</a>.</p>

<h2>Verdict: Do Under Desk Elliptical Machines Work?</h2>
<p>They do, as long as you match the type to the goal. For most desk workers who want to move more and burn a bit extra, a quiet manual seated elliptical is the best all-rounder. If pedaling is difficult, a motorized leg exerciser keeps you moving, though it is a comfort tool more than a workout. Choose a desk bike if you want more resistance, and a stepper only if you work at a standing desk.</p>
<p>Our top all-round pick remains the [[amazon:cubii-jr2|Cubii JR2]] for its quiet magnetic resistance and smooth stride.</p>
